<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34582" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφᾰγεῖν</span></b> , inf. of aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέφαγον</span> (no pres.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεσθίω</span> being in use), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				89
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				9.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				5.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; esp. in <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i>, <i>eat hastily</i>, 'snatch a bite', 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφαγόντες ὅ τι δύναιντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>HG</u>
					4.5.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκέλευον αὐτοὺς ἐμφαγόντας πορεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>An.</u>
					4.2.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.1.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>eat in</i> or <i>upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρυσὸς κοῖλος ἡμῖν ἐμφαγεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nav.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
